{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island Of Enchantment is a relaxing and engaging hidden-object casual game. Within a limited time, you must help <strong>four charming girls</strong> find their lost items. With <strong>13 carefully designed levels</strong> ranging from easy to challenging, there's always something new to discover!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>A Huge Variety of Items \u2013 Test Your Observation Skills</strong><br>Each level requires you to find several specific objects, while the screen is filled with <strong>400+ items</strong>. With diverse types and cluttered arrangements, every challenge is both exciting and visually stimulating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Race Against Time \u2013 Addictive Gameplay</strong><br>Find all the required items before the timer runs out!<br>Enjoy the thrill of searching under pressure.<br>If you get stuck, simply click the <strong>Hint Button</strong> on the right to get some help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Endless Mode \u2013 The Ultimate Visual Challenge</strong><br>Looking for something even more intense? Try the <strong>Endless Mode</strong>!<br>Collect time-boosting items to survive longer and compete for the top score on the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>.<br>Achieve high scores and leave your name proudly displayed for all players to see!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Easy to Play, Fun for All Ages</strong><br>Whether you're a fan of hidden-object games, need a relaxing break, or just want to test your observation skills, this game offers a pleasant and enjoyable experience for everyone.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2899680?t=1768289989","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2899680?t=1768289989","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899680/4b18dbc4b5bb9899dd5eac94637719c0b8bb98ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768289989","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899680/4b18dbc4b5bb9899dd5eac94637719c0b8bb98ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768289989","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contains general sexual maturity content and may not be suitable for access in all situations, such as study and workplaces, please note!"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island Of Enchantment is a relaxing and engaging hidden-object casual game. Within a limited time, you must help <strong>four charming girls</strong> find their lost items. With <strong>13 carefully designed levels</strong> ranging from easy to challenging, there's always something new to discover!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>A Huge Variety of Items \u2013 Test Your Observation Skills</strong><br>Each level requires you to find several specific objects, while the screen is filled with <strong>400+ items</strong>. With diverse types and cluttered arrangements, every challenge is both exciting and visually stimulating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f1\ufe0f <strong>Race Against Time \u2013 Addictive Gameplay</strong><br>Find all the required items before the timer runs out!<br>Enjoy the thrill of searching under pressure.<br>If you get stuck, simply click the <strong>Hint Button</strong> on the right to get some help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Endless Mode \u2013 The Ultimate Visual Challenge</strong>